  "historyNote": "#10753, INTERIM, eff 1-1-15, EXPIRED: 6-30-15 New. #10890, eff 7-16-15 ss by #13186, eff 4-7-21 (formerly Saf-C 302.27); ss by #13186, eff 4-7-21 (formerly Saf-C 302.27)",
